{"unit_id": "xfgil__dsh-link-parse#feature-1", "repo": "xfgil/dsh-link-parse", "commit": "7d08540dfb9b0934fa4843c1096d098c371aa108", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-link-parse 的功能「解析分享链接」：用户调用 link_parse 并传入 URL 或含链接的文字；插件识别 B 站、抖音、小黑盒和 GitHub 页面，返回标题、作者、描述及可用的图片或视频信息。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:182-220"]}
